{"id":51495,"date":"2026-05-30T00:10:26","date_gmt":"2026-05-29T23:10:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51495"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:43:27","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:43:27","slug":"ecotur-skymarathon-porto-moniz","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ecotur-skymarathon-porto-moniz\/","title":{"rendered":"Ecotur Skymarathon Porto Moniz 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ecotur Skymarathon Porto Moniz 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ecotur Skymarathon Porto Moniz 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>30 de Agosto de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong> no emblem\u00e1tico concelho de <strong>Porto Moniz<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>. Integrando o circuito oficial de Skyrunning sob a \u00e9gide da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e Montanhismo de Portugal (FCMP), o evento desafia os atletas pelas vertiginosas encostas da floresta Laurissilva e maci\u00e7os montanhosos da costa norte madeirense.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo do <strong>CDCPM \u2013 Clube Desportivo e Cultural do Porto Moniz<\/strong> e apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Porto Moniz, o programa desportivo contempla a exigente <strong>SkyMarathon de 43 km (2800m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>06:00<\/strong> na Praia da Laje (Seixal), a <strong>SkyRace de 22 km (1300m D+)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> na Ribeira da Janela, e o <strong>Sky Mini de 10 km (700m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, com meta comum na C\u00e2mara Municipal de Porto Moniz.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Agosto de 2026 \u00e0s 06:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; fle